Source of truth: `FILTERS.md`. Agent workflow: `AGENTS.md`. Read both before evaluating any listing. Check `listings/rejected.md` first.

Hard filters (condensed — FILTERS.md wins on conflict):
- R-BUDGET: asking €80k–159k; above €159k or below €80k excluded immediately. WHITE VARIANT: asking ≤€90k (>€90k FAIL even if <€159k); unknown finish = MAYBE (2026-11-17).
- R-BANDS: ONE single price band: €80k–159k inclusive (2026-11-21). QUOTAS: PASS ≤10, MAYBE separate status ≤10 TOTAL (own quota, does NOT consume PASS quota).
- MAYBE PUBLICATION: MAYBE now PUBLISHED with literal tag and specific reasons (e.g. year unverified — must confirm ≥2000). PASS = fully verified; MAYBE = unknown/contradictory but no confirmed violation; FAIL = confirmed violation, excluded. Include all material unknowns, required verification, never fabricate. Unknown year may publish as MAYBE; known <2000 FAIL (unless Stalinka/102).
- R-TYPE/R-AREA/R-LAYOUT: any number of rooms; total area ≥55 m² (known <55 m² = FAIL; unknown = MAYBE); R-PRICE-M2: ≤€2,200/m² (2026-11-20; was €2,100); own kitchen, bath, hallway, no walk-through rooms.
- R-YEAR / R-EXCL-OLD-STOCK (2026-11-22): OLD HOUSING STOCK EXCLUDED ENTIRELY. ONLY buildings ≥2000 AND commissioned eligible. Any pre-2000 building = FAIL. Any Soviet/typical series = FAIL. Renovation doesn't count. Unverified year with no old-stock indication = MAYBE (must verify ≥2000), never PASS. Pre-2000 exception (Stalinka/102/143/Czech/individual) REVOKED 2026-11-22 20:52 (was allowed 15.11–22.11.2026).
- R-FLOOR: apartments floor ≥2 (second floor and above); no upper limit (2026-11-21); single-storey houses exception. R-TOPFLOOR: top floor flagged.
- R-LIFT: informational only; high floor without lift flagged but NEVER excluded.
- R-MANSARD/R-HOUSE: mansards allowed (flag roof/legal/cadastral); single-storey houses allowed (flag legal/cadastral/land); exception to R-FLOOR/R-LIFT.
- R-EXCL-*: no hostel/gostinka, soclu/demisol/pe sol, grey variant (white variant allowed ≤€90k, add renovation estimate), uncommissioned new build, suburbs (Durlești, Codru, Stăuceni, etc.; no exceptions); ignore promoted 999.md ads.
- R-LOC (2026-11-21): ONLY Centru (whole sector), whole Rîșcani sector EXCEPT Poșta Veche (Poșta Veche excluded; Rîșcanovca, Petricani, Cartierul Moldova/Socoleni, Studenților etc. allowed, but Ceucari and Braniștii blacklisted R-BLACKLIST 2026-11-21), whole Botanica sector EXCEPT Malaia Malina and Bolșaia Malina (micro-districts/streets blacklisted R-BLACKLIST 2026-11-21 23:06; all other Botanica locations evaluated by standard filters, PASS possible; was entirely excluded 02.11–21.11.2026), and Buiucani near Komsomol lake/Valea Morilor (~0–20 min walk including adjacent Buiucani). EVERYTHING ELSE EXCLUDED: Poșta Veche, other Buiucani, Telecentru, all Ciocana (incl. former Port Mall exception, revoked 2026-11-12), suburbs. Unclear micro-district (e.g. only 'Rîșcani' without street/map) = MAYBE. + R-ALBA-IULIA (2026-11-21): whole str. Alba Iulia in Chișinău (incl. Sculeanca) is location-OK regardless of lake distance, but ALWAYS MAYBE at most (never PASS) with note «Алба Юлия — вне основной зоны (Скулянка/Буюканы)»; suburb Alba Iulia excluded.
- R-MICRO: ≤5–10 min walk to main road, park or university; R-LAKE 20-min priority overrides this.
- R-BLACKLIST / R-BLACKLIST-BUILDING (2026-11-22): Streets (10): Drumul Viilor (2026-11-13); Valea Dicescu (2026-11-15); Calea Ieșilor (2026-11-15); Grădinilor (2026-11-15); Pajurii (Chișinău Rîșcani; variants Pajurii/Păjurii/Пажурий) (2026-11-21 21:00; was in East Rîșcani pocket 2026-11-01 to 2026-11-20, re-blacklisted); Ceucari (Chișinău Rîșcani; variants Ceucari/Чеукарь) (2026-11-21 21:09); Braniștii (Chișinău Rîșcani; variants Braniștii/Branistii/Брэништий/Браништий) (2026-11-21 21:09); Gagarin (Chișinău Centru; variants Iuri Gagarin/Gagarin/Гагарина) (2026-11-21 21:21); Tudor Vladimirescu (Chișinău Rîșcani; variants Тудор Владимиреску) (2026-11-21 21:21; re-blacklisted, was removed 2026-11-19); Muncești (Chișinău; variants Мунчешть/Muncesti/Munceşti) (2026-11-22 19:46). Areas (2): Malaia Malina / Bolșaia Malina (Chișinău Botanica; micro-districts and streets; variants Малая Малина/Большая Малина/Malina Mică/Malina Mare) (2026-11-21 23:06; unclear address = MAYBE with map check). Buildings (1): bd. Dacia 59 (Chișinău Botanica; complex Edera Home; any apartment in this building) (2026-11-22 21:30; only this building number; other bd. Dacia numbers evaluated normally; Dacia 59/x naming Edera Home = FAIL; unclear = MAYBE with check). East Rîșcani streets (Florării, Forăriei, Zimbrului) removed from blacklist 2026-11-20; Pajurii re-blacklisted 2026-11-21; Tudor Vladimirescu re-blacklisted 2026-11-21.
- R-CET1-INFO (2026-11-21): CET-1 zone exclusion REMOVED entirely. All addresses (Nicolae Dimo, Florării, Forăriei, Zimbrului, and ~800 m around CET-1) now evaluated by standard filters. CET-1 proximity flagged as informational only ("близко к ТЭЦ-1"), NOT exclusion. Must verify locality/address, not bare street name; unclear locality = MAYBE. Note: Pajurii blacklisted (R-BLACKLIST 2026-11-21 21:00); Tudor Vladimirescu (Chișinău Rîșcani) re-blacklisted (R-BLACKLIST 2026-11-21 21:21).

TELEGRAM POSTING (2026-11-20): Morning run (~09:00) with NO fresh PASS or MAYBE => post ONE short Russian message (nothing new + one-line filter summary €80–159k, ≥55 m², ≤€2200/m², этаж от 2-го, Центр, Рышкановка (без Старой Почты), Ботаника (без Малой/Большой Малины), озеро Комсомольское + вся ул. Алба Юлия (только MAYBE) + coverage summary; honest if partial). NOT posted if run failed (failure → Grok Bot chat). Message adds nothing to posted_ids. Buffer runs (12:00/19:00) unchanged: empty buffer => no message.

Output: PASS/MAYBE/FAIL with rule IDs. Never invent numbers. Reply to Andrew in Russian. Update FILTERS.md + listings + CHANGELOG.md when rules change.
